pic","role":"collection","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An Origami → SwiftUI translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".origami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"url":"\/documentation\/swami","title":"Swami","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_PinchView/accessibilityDragPoint(_:description:isEnabled:)-4zebw":{"url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_pinchview\/accessibilitydragpoint(_:description:isenabled:)-4zebw","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_PinchView\/accessibilityDragPoint(_:description:isEnabled:)-4zebw","title":"accessibilityDragPoint(_:description:isEnabled:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"accessibilityDragPoint","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"UnitPoint","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI9UnitPointV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"description","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Text","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4TextV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"isEnabled","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":